<!--
corona-gerboa-narrator: the Council's Storyteller (avatar of the Corona).
A member of the Council as a giant jerboa nobleman (scale 20 vpt, base anatomy with ears forward).
It wears a sumptuous Victorian top hat in black velvet with an anatomical brim set between the ears,
a bright pure gold silk band (agent colour #ffcf5c), a storyteller's goose quill/glowing stylus
with a shining tip tucked into the band on the right, and a golden little scarf/tie knotted under the chin.
Box: 1.6 × 2.2 × 2.1 tiles, 32 × 44 × 42 voxels, 20 voxels per tile (vpt: 20).
Role: npc.
-->
